<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How Leonida Atlas handles your data: the Leonida Log stays in your browser, and what to expect if ads or cookies are added.">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="meta">Last updated: November 19, 2026</p>
  <h2>Your Leonida Log stays on your device</h2>
  <p>Entries you add to the Leonida Log are saved in your browser's localStorage. They are not sent to our servers and we cannot see them. Clearing your browser data deletes them. The shareable rank card is generated locally in your browser.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>We do not ask you to create an account and we do not collect personal information through forms. Our hosting provider may keep standard server logs (such as IP address and requested page) for security and operation.</p>
  <h2>Future ads and cookies</h2>
  <p>We may show advertising or use analytics in the future. If we do, third-party vendors may use cookies or similar technologies to serve ads or measure traffic. This policy will be updated before that happens, including how to opt out and, where required, a consent prompt.</p>
  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>We link to third-party sites such as the Rockstar Games newswire. Their privacy practices are their own.</p>
</Base>
